Package: strawwu-session
Version: __VERSION__
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-session-bin, gnome-session-common, gnome-settings-daemon (>= 3.37.0), gnome-shell (>= 45), xwayland, session-migration
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Provides: x-session-manager
Description: StrawWU desktop session (GNOME Shell interim)
 Registers the StrawWU session for GDM and launches GNOME Shell
 with StrawWU branding until strawwu-shell (W4-D2) replaces the
 compositor. Hub autostart is enabled when the Hub package is present.
